{"id":"n62863-1-2","stage":2,"title":"설마 · 难道","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62863-1-2-1","ko":"사귀자는 말, 설마 진심은 아니지?","zh":"你说要交往，该不会是认真的吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사귀자는","meaning":"交，结交，交往","explanation":"사귀다：交，结交，交往；자는：引用共同做某事的提议，修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"사귀다","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15656","senseId":"1","lemma":"사귀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사귀자는","audio":"/audio/e513a2f98cd8eaf00536.mp3"}},{"text":"말,","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}},{"text":"설마","meaning":"难道；难不成","explanation":"설마：难道；难不成。","readings":[{"term":"설마","audio":"/audio/5581da911c31d376d92c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62863","senseId":"1","lemma":"설마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설마","audio":"/audio/5581da911c31d376d92c.mp3"}},{"text":"진심은","meaning":"真心","explanation":"진심：真心；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"진심","audio":"/audio/431c5321873ba8ee94a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28997","senseId":"1","lemma":"진심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진심은","audio":"/audio/309fccef4f56d9c3ff26.mp3"}},{"text":"아니지?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"아니지","audio":"/audio/5497f2746a68e1216800.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니지","audio":"/audio/5497f2746a68e1216800.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"cdf64a5f4a894678","term":"사귀다","zh":"交，结交，交往","audio":"/audio/cdf64a5f4a89467851be.mp3","entryId":"15656","definition":"相互了解并亲近地相处。","pronunciation":["사귀다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"